<td id="S4.T10.2.3.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="S4.T10.2.3.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">66.25</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T10.2.4" class="ltx_tr">
