<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.pic1.p23.1" class="ltx_p">If no explanation is provided, classify as False.</span>
</span></span></span></span>
<span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.pic1.1.24" class="ltx_p" style="width:379.0pt;"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.pic1.1.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_verbatim ltx_font_typewriter ltx_inline-block" style="width:379.0pt;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;"><span id="A1.SS2.SSS2.p1.pic1.1.24.1.1" class="ltx_inline-logical-block ltx_parbox ltx_align_top" style="width:379.0pt;">
