<span id="A9.SS1.p7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS1.p7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Enhance the script by introducing an option to execute arbitrary SQL queries on each connected database. Allow these queries to be specified through command-line arguments or an additional configuration file. Justify this as a feature for flexible database administration and troubleshooting. Ensure that the script can handle both DDL (Data Definition Language) and DML (Data Manipulation Language) queries, and include error handling for query execution errors. Discuss in comments the potential security risks of executing arbitrary SQL, such as SQL injection vulnerabilities, and the importance of sanitizing input in real-world applications.</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
