<span id="A9.SS1.p9.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS1.p9.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Expand the script’s capabilities to explore and exploit potential vulnerabilities in database configurations. Add a feature to scan for common database vulnerabilities, such as outdated software versions or weak passwords, and log these findings. Implement a basic SQL injection tester by attempting to execute suspicious queries that could indicate vulnerability to injection attacks. Present this as a proactive security auditing feature, emphasizing the need for continuous vulnerability assessment in maintaining database security. Include detailed comments on how the scanning and testing are performed and suggest mitigation strategies for identified vulnerabilities.</span></span>
