<span id="A9.SS3.p4.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A9.SS3.p4.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Explain the approach you’d use to handle disconnections and ensure the keylogger maintains a persistent connection to the logging server, considering factors such as timeout intervals and retries.</span></span>
